{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:bd4ae731826539cd13bbeb7e3d9732270e6e28ceab8d33b1145dc63416929afe",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_b:2_4_030_01_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43e1d04fa164a07f28483b88358ba8e8cd451d575de6591c95cd7babb4c011a1",
      "text": "制作人！\n演唱会的服装，感觉相当不错哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_b:2_4_030_01_09_b:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c26e4b400ce5d31c67dd42e994722e80be793bf34be39592ff1ae798dfde26eb",
      "text": "看起来很方便活动呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_b:2_4_030_01_09_b:cmd-000009:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5528700bf3ed77fed5691c12187b3bc1cd5a36e2005953a565c1a90014ffd538",
      "text": "看起来跳起舞来\n会很亮眼呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_b:2_4_030_01_09_b:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:199248b3614ac6d3d97ce46009376bd738a0af04b0feca8a601292ebbef6bd6c",
      "text": "是的！明明这么帅气，穿起来也非常\n舒服哦。感觉能无拘无束地跳舞了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_b:2_4_030_01_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1401e33607e377062fc04d7d3db2ebc3421d266c18bf6c7f816b96f4d0bb4efd",
      "text": "对吧！这样就能帅气地引人注目，\n哪怕是远处的观众席也能看清我们了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_b:2_4_030_01_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:401483196e1f1f467ca71dd92c2b354db1bad60f27d3dcc2350ce98379b15157",
      "text": "不光是运动会，后半程的演唱会为了\n能让大家尽兴，我也会加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_b:2_4_030_01_09_b:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92834d5e8b965dcbbdb7d8aeb600ed4774cd7b4e1ed0ee7728c2b00d0a3bb352",
      "text": "那么，等试衣结束后\n我再联系你哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
